    /// bounds in [`FjallConfig::MIN_CACHE_SIZE_BYTES`] /
    /// [`FjallConfig::MAX_CACHE_SIZE_BYTES`]. Out-of-range values return
    /// [`JournalError::InvalidConfig`] before any Fjall call.
